      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1750486205668,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional \n* User can post a tweet\n   * Includes media (photo, video)\n* User can follow & unfollow others\n* User can view their timeline \n    * Only includes tweets from those user follows\n* User can favorite/unfavorite a post\n\nBonus: Functional\n* Search\n* Reweet\n* Composite Feed, more than those you follow.\n\nNon-Functional\n* Prioritize availability. Users don't need to see a\ntweet immediately\n* Timeline viewing should take ~200 ms",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional \n* User can post a tweet\n   * Includes media (photo, video)\n* User can follow & unfollow others\n* User can view their timeline \n    * Only includes tweets from those user follows\n* User can favorite/unfavorite a post\n\nBonus: Functional\n* Search\n* Reweet\n* Composite Feed, more than those you follow.\n\nNon-Functional\n* Prioritize availability. Users don't need to see a tweet immediately\n* Timeline viewing should take ~200 ms",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
